{"id":"G4969","lema":"σφάζω","lemaStrong":"σφάζω","translit":"spházō","pron":"","glosa":"","defStrong":"to butcher (especially an animal for food or in sacrifice) or (generally) to slaughter, or (specially), to maim (violently)","defKjv":"kill, slay, wound","derivacion":"a primary verb;","veces":10,"versos":9,"refs":["1 Jn 3:12","Ap 5:6","Ap 5:9","Ap 5:12","Ap 6:4","Ap 6:9","Ap 13:3","Ap 13:8","Ap 18:24"],"texto":"Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894)"}